l get back up again, but when a trainer is knocked out, that trainer loses the battle.</li></ul><br><strong><u><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore and Collect!</h2></u></strong><br><br>There is lots of exploring to be done with your grimmlin friends! Throughout the game you will be collecting golden books mysteriously checked out under your name like a modern day collectathon!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1785520/extras/e22316d591fc58768e6dcdef88ba9560.poster.avif?t=1710642645\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1785520/extras/e22316d591fc58768e6dcdef88ba9560.webm?t=1710642645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1785520/extras/e22316d591fc58768e6dcdef88ba9560.mp4?t=1710642645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1785520/extras/f9240693275f8f06250888ac733d10c4.poster.avif?t=1710642645\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1785520/extras/f9240693275f8f06250888ac733d10c4.webm?t=1710642645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1785520/extras/f9240693275f8f06250888ac733d10c4.mp4?t=1710642645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1785520/extras/4f5c4fc822c1b11fa78ea456579ab29e.poster.avif?t=1710642645\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1785520/extras/4f5c4fc822c1b11fa78ea456579ab29e.webm?t=1710642645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1785520/extras/4f5c4fc822c1b11fa78ea456579ab29e.mp4?t=1710642645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong><u><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Let's Ride!</h2></u></strong><br><br>The player can climb and explore freely, but that's nothing compared to what your grimmlins can do for you! <br>In Grimmlins Tale, riding and unique platforming abilities are taken to the extreme!<br>Each grimmlin can help you get around and platform, and the large ones let you control them directly when riding! Double jump, build platforms, dash, roll, glide, and more with the help of your fairy tale friends!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1785520/extras/4ef1495cb93c282f3ec9a3bb7be626d1.poster.avif?t=1710642645\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1785520/extras/4ef1495cb93c282f3ec9a3bb7be626d1.webm?t=1710642645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1785520/extras/4ef1495cb93c282f3ec9a3bb7be626d1.mp4?t=1710642645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1785520/extras/bfccf082eeea346aaf8f9663865e2bec.poster.avif?t=1710642645\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1785520/extras/bfccf082eeea346aaf8f9663865e2bec.webm?t=1710642645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1785520/extras/bfccf082eeea346aaf8f9663865e2bec.mp4?t=1710642645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1785520/extras/041dde69ad85103481df44eb27287930.poster.avif?t=1710642645\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1785520/extras/041dde69ad85103481df44eb27287930.webm?t=1710642645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1785520/extras/041dde69ad85103481df44eb27287930.mp4?t=1710642645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
